---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import heroImage from "../assets/Banner_SeniorSchool.png";
import PageSection from "../components/PageSection.astro";
import FramedImage from "../components/FramedImage.astro";
import IntroBlock from "../components/IntroBlock.astro";
import SectionBreakLeaf from "../components/SectionBreakLeaf.astro";

import kivakamp1 from "../assets/kivakamp1.png";
import kivakamp2 from "../assets/kivakamp2.png";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={null} heroSrc={heroImage.src}>
  <IntroBlock>
    <PageSection title="Parent Engagement" headingLevel={1}>
      <div class="stack-lg">
        <p>
          The Parental Engagement Program aims to support the social emotional
          development of our students and encourage lifelong learning, through
          the active participation of our parent commu-nity. The goal is to
          establish shared responsibility, meaningful involvement and
          collaboration between parents and teachers for the healthy development
          of our students. As part of this initiative, parents are encouraged to
          participate in the events and meetings hosted by the school to create
          an active rapport between parents and teachers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </PageSection>
  </IntroBlock>

  <IntroBlock>
    <PageSection title="Children's Day Celebration 2024" headingLevel={1}>
      <FramedImage imgSrc={kivakamp1.src} />
      <div class="stack-lg">
        <p>
          Nothing is more meaningful, than to have our parents cheer us on,
          while we get messy and explore with no inhibitions. Children's Day was
          a momentous occasion, where our parents facilitated and curated
          activities around graffiti art and tote bag screen printing for all
          the little stars at Kiva. Ending on a high note, grounding our energy,
          the event concluded with a Drum Circle, for parents and their children
          to enjoy with free abandon. Let's just say being messy and loud was a
          requirement!
        </p>
      </div>
    </PageSection>
  </IntroBlock>

  <SectionBreakLeaf />

  <IntroBlock>
    <PageSection title="Story Fest 2025" headingLevel={1}>
      <FramedImage imgSrc={kivakamp2.src} />
      <div class="stack-lg">
        <p>
          Story Fest marked a momentous occasion at Kiva, whereby parents and
          teachers came together to plan, organize and execute a meticulous
          performance for our students. Titled, "Giraffes Can't Dance", based on
          the book by Giles Andreae, the enactment of this story was rich in
          lessons on finding your own tune and being compassionate and kind to
          those around you. An experience filled with rhythm, creativity and
          fun, Story Fest was the perfect blend of interactive storytelling.
          music and art put together by parents after a series of rehearsals on
          the school premises
        </p>
      </div>
    </PageSection>
  </IntroBlock>
</BaseLayout>
